course: dictionary
lesson: 13909
title: Words for drinks in a café
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: A café menu can have words you have never seen before. Use the words around them to help. «Dad ordered a latte, and I had hot chocolate.» Dad and hot chocolate are both drinks, so a latte must be a drink too.
explain: «The barista made my latte with lots of foam on top.» A barista is the person who makes the coffee, and foam is the light, bubbly layer on top. Check your guess by swapping in your meaning: "The barista made my hot drink with lots of foam on top" still makes sense.
explain: Extra words tell you more about the drink. «She chose an oat latte because she likes oat milk.» Oat tells you the kind of milk, but the drink is still a latte. «He ordered a matcha latte, and it was bright green.» Here the first word tells you the flavour or colour, and latte names the drink.
fact: A latte is a coffee drink made with espresso and lots of hot steamed milk.
fact: A latte often has foam on top.
fact: Words like «oat», «chai» and «matcha» tell you what kind of latte it is, as in «oat latte» or «chai latte».
fact: Coffee has caffeine, which is not good for children in large amounts.
exercise: «Dad ordered a latte, and I had hot chocolate.» What is a latte? | A type of school bag | A kind of birthday cake | *A coffee drink with hot steamed milk
exercise: «The barista made my latte with lots of foam on top.» What does foam look like? | Long and thin like a rope | Dark and heavy like mud | *Light, soft and bubbly | Hard, cold and sharp
exercise: «She chose an oat latte.» What does the word oat tell you? | The time of day she ordered | The size of the cup | *The kind of milk in the drink | The price of the drink
test: «The café was busy, and everyone was ordering lattes.» Where is this happening? | A swimming pool | *A café | A school gym | A railway station
test: Why should children not drink too many lattes? | It only tastes good to adults | It makes you grow taller too fast | *It has caffeine, which is not good for children in large amounts | It is too cold to drink
exam: «Mum said, "A latte is just coffee and hot milk, love."» What is a latte made with? | Hot chocolate and cream | Orange juice and ice | *Espresso and hot steamed milk | Tea and cold lemonade
